/Title (Lead Qualification Automation Designed an intelligent lead intake workflow that automatically creates or updates opportunities, sends confirmation emails, applies tags, waits for booking activity, and routes contacts using conditional logic. This workflow minimizes manual follow-up while ensuring every inquiry follows a consistent customer journey.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 994 0 R
/Next 999 0 R
>>
